#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:7
msgid "Problem definition and ranking"
msgstr "問題定義と順位付け"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:9
msgid ""
"`Problem` brings the objective function, objective directions, "
"SearchSpace, and constraints together as one optimization target. "
"Constraint handling computes candidate feasibility and violations, and "
"`Comparator` compares those results with objective values. For multiple "
"objectives, `Dominator` defines dominance and `NonDominatedSorter` builds"
" layers of non-dominated solutions from that relation. `Decomposition` "
"scalarizes multiple objectives to enable decomposition-based comparison."
msgstr ""
"`Problem`は、評価対象の関数、目的方向、探索空間、制約を一つの最適化対象としてまとめます。 "
"制約処理は候補の実行可能性と制約違反を計算し、その結果を`Comparator`が目的値と合わせて比較します。 "
"複数目的では`Dominator`が優越関係を定め、`NonDominatedSorter`がその関係から非劣解の階層を作ります。 "
"`Decomposition`は複数の目的をスカラー化し、分解に基づく比較を可能にします。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:18
msgid "Problem"
msgstr "{fa}`compass;sd-mr-1` 問題"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:21
msgid ""
"Defines the objective function, variables, objective directions, "
"constraints, and SearchSpace."
msgstr "目的関数、変数、目的方向、制約、探索空間を定義します。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:24
msgid "SearchSpace"
msgstr "{fa}`square-root-variable;sd-mr-1` 探索空間"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:27
msgid ""
"Defines candidate representation and the services needed for sampling and"
" validation."
msgstr "候補の表現と、サンプリングや検証に必要なサービスを定義します。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:30
msgid "Constraint handling"
msgstr "{fa}`filter;sd-mr-1` 制約処理"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:33
msgid "Replaces violation aggregation, feasibility checks, and repair."
msgstr "制約違反の集約、実行可能性の判定、修復を差し替えます。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:36
msgid "Comparator"
msgstr "{fa}`arrow-down-up-across-line;sd-mr-1` 比較器"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:39
msgid "Ranks solutions from objective values and constraint violations."
msgstr "目的値と制約違反から解を順位付けします。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:42
msgid "Dominator"
msgstr "{fa}`crown;sd-mr-1` 支配判定器"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:45
msgid ""
"Defines dominance relations between solutions, such as Pareto and "
"ε-dominance."
msgstr "Pareto優越やε優越など、解どうしの優越関係を定めます。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:48
msgid "Non-dominated sorter"
msgstr "{fa}`arrow-down-wide-short;sd-mr-1` 非劣解ソーター"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:51
msgid ""
"Splits a population into non-dominated fronts using the dominance "
"relation."
msgstr "優越関係を使って集団を非劣解フロントへ分けます。"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:54
msgid "Decomposition"
msgstr "{fa}`scissors;sd-mr-1` 分解"

#: ../../concepts/problem_and_ranking.md:57
msgid "Provides decomposition functions that scalarize multiple objectives."
msgstr "複数目的をスカラー化する分解関数を提供します。"
